# .NET build output.
#
# Scoped to dotnet/ rather than added to the repository root .gitignore: the .NET
# artifacts are this folder's, and the root list covers the rest.

bin/
obj/

# Two root rules catch .NET folders by accident, so they are re-included here:
#  - "build/" (a build folder anywhere) also matches dotnet/build/, the shared MSBuild props and targets;
#  - "*.app" (a macOS app bundle) also matches TmDq.App/, because git on Windows ignores case.
# Without these lines git status does not even list them, and a commit silently leaves them out.
!build/
!TmDq.App/
